  (limitation "93 finite predeclared witnesses: all 32 forms at chosen values, static and dynamic rounding, a reserved mode refused even where nothing can round, the flags and their accrual, tininess after rounding, the canonical NaN, payloads kept by the transfers and sign injection, a boxed single seen as the quiet NaN it appears as, FCVT.S.D rounding and boxing, FCVT.D.S widening and reading through the box, a signaling NaN into a conversion, conversions clipping and NaN inputs, FEQ quiet and FLT signaling, FS Off refusing and Dirty following an f-register or a flag alone; numeric results stand at these values, with no claim of exhaustiveness, a reserved mode is witnessed on FCVT.D.W and FCVT.D.S, not on FCVT.D.WU, and FS Off is witnessed on a move, a load and an arithmetic form, not on every form; full source/risk/feature policy remains pending.")
  (source_id "RVI-D") (source_locator "21.1.4") (category "defined") (risk "high")
  (coverage "93 witnesses: the 32 forms, rounding, flags, NaN rules, the two format conversions and clipping")
